Apple software
--------------
No Apple software, firmware or image is distributed here. The macOS image, its NVRAM and the
AVPBooter firmware are fetched or extracted by the user on their own machine, under the terms
that apply to them. Screenshots in docs/img show the guest's own UI for documentation.
